{"operationalLayers":[{"id":"__item_ea5131a967e04b1aae92c2eee08bb876","title":"Trails West","visibility":true,"opacity":1,"layerType":"ArcGISFeatureLayer","itemId":"ea5131a967e04b1aae92c2eee08bb876","url":"https://services7.arcgis.com/iFGeGXTAJXnjq0YN/arcgis/rest/services/Trails_West/FeatureServer/0"},{"id":"__sketch_points","title":"My sketches","layerType":"ArcGISFeatureLayer","visibility":true,"opacity":1,"showLegend":false,"showLabels":false,"featureCollection":{"showLegend":false,"layers":[{"layerDefinition":{"name":"My sketches (points)","type":"Feature Layer","geometryType":"esriGeometryPoint","objectIdField":"ObjectId","fields":[{"name":"ObjectId","alias":"ObjectId","type":"esriFieldTypeOID"},{"name":"uid","alias":"uid","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":40},{"name":"kind","alias":"kind","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":20},{"name":"title","alias":"Title","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":300},{"name":"description","alias":"Description","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":5000},{"name":"imageUrl","alias":"Image","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":3000000},{"name":"color","alias":"color","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":7},{"name":"size","alias":"size","type":"esriFieldTypeDouble"},{"name":"rotation","alias":"rotation","type":"esriFieldTypeDouble"},{"name":"_style","alias":"_style","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":40}],"drawingInfo":{"renderer":{"type":"uniqueValue","field1":"_style","uniqueValueInfos":[{"value":"#7a3e9d|12|0","label":"","symbol":{"type":"esriSMS","style":"esriSMSCircle","color":[122,62,157,255],"size":12,"angle":0,"outline":{"type":"esriSLS","style":"esriSLSSolid","color":[255,255,255,255],"width":1.1}}},{"value":"#333333|12|0","label":"","symbol":{"type":"esriSMS","style":"esriSMSCircle","color":[51,51,51,255],"size":12,"angle":0,"outline":{"type":"esriSLS","style":"esriSLSSolid","color":[255,255,255,255],"width":1.1}}}]}}},"featureSet":{"geometryType":"esriGeometryPoint","features":[{"geometry":{"x":-10510285.38299232,"y":4734729.279460487,"spatialReference":{"wkid":102100,"latestWkid":3857}},"attributes":{"ObjectId":1,"uid":"t000047","kind":"point","title":"Independence, Missouri","description":"Start of the trail. Wagon trains set off in April or May, when there was spring grass to feed the animals.","imageUrl":"","color":"#7a3e9d","size":12,"rotation":0,"_style":"#7a3e9d|12|0"}},{"geometry":{"x":-11504680.130350476,"y":5116683.049031215,"spatialReference":{"wkid":102100,"latestWkid":3857}},"attributes":{"ObjectId":2,"uid":"t000048","kind":"point","title":"Chimney Rock","description":"A tall rock spire that travelers could see for days. It told them they were on the right route along the North Platte River.","imageUrl":"","color":"#7a3e9d","size":12,"rotation":0,"_style":"#7a3e9d|12|0"}},{"geometry":{"x":-11925812.895970508,"y":5235252.806508108,"spatialReference":{"wkid":102100,"latestWkid":3857}},"attributes":{"ObjectId":3,"uid":"t000049","kind":"point","title":"Independence Rock","description":"Travelers hoped to reach it by July 4, so they could cross the mountains before the autumn snows. Many carved their names on it.","imageUrl":"","color":"#7a3e9d","size":12,"rotation":0,"_style":"#7a3e9d|12|0"}},{"geometry":{"x":-12124918.937203357,"y":5215059.174610623,"spatialReference":{"wkid":102100,"latestWkid":3857}},"attributes":{"ObjectId":4,"uid":"t000050","kind":"point","title":"South Pass","description":"A wide, gentle pass where wagons could cross the Rocky Mountains (the Continental Divide).","imageUrl":"","color":"#7a3e9d","size":12,"rotation":0,"_style":"#7a3e9d|12|0"}},{"geometry":{"x":-13648526.543792734,"y":5677947.546476853,"spatialReference":{"wkid":102100,"latestWkid":3857}},"attributes":{"ObjectId":5,"uid":"t000051","kind":"point","title":"Oregon City","description":"The end of the trail, in the Willamette Valley, where many families claimed farmland.","imageUrl":"","color":"#7a3e9d","size":12,"rotation":0,"_style":"#7a3e9d|12|0"}},{"geometry":{"x":-11131949.079327356,"y":5780349.220256351,"spatialReference":{"wkid":102100,"latestWkid":3857}},"attributes":{"ObjectId":6,"uid":"t000053","kind":"point","title":"Why did people go West?","description":"Many went for land and money. The Trails West layer says people were \"pursuing economic opportunities or cheap land recently taken from Native Americans\", and some went for the gold rush or the idea of Manifest Destiny.","imageUrl":"","color":"#333333","size":12,"rotation":0,"_style":"#333333|12|0"}}]},"nextObjectId":7,"popupInfo":{"title":"{title}","description":"{description}","fieldInfos":[{"fieldName":"title","label":"Title","visible":true},{"fieldName":"description","label":"Description","visible":true}],"popupElements":[{"type":"text","text":"{description}"}],"showAttachments":false}}]}},{"id":"__sketch_lines","title":"My sketches (lines)","layerType":"ArcGISFeatureLayer","visibility":true,"opacity":1,"showLegend":false,"showLabels":false,"featureCollection":{"showLegend":false,"layers":[{"layerDefinition":{"name":"My sketches (lines)","type":"Feature Layer","geometryType":"esriGeometryPolyline","objectIdField":"ObjectId","fields":[{"name":"ObjectId","alias":"ObjectId","type":"esriFieldTypeOID"},{"name":"uid","alias":"uid","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":40},{"name":"kind","alias":"kind","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":20},{"name":"title","alias":"Title","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":300},{"name":"description","alias":"Description","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":5000},{"name":"imageUrl","alias":"Image","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":3000000},{"name":"color","alias":"color","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":7},{"name":"size","alias":"size","type":"esriFieldTypeDouble"},{"name":"rotation","alias":"rotation","type":"esriFieldTypeDouble"},{"name":"_style","alias":"_style","type":"esriFieldTypeString","length":40}],"drawingInfo":{"renderer":{"type":"uniqueValue","field1":"_style","uniqueValueInfos":[{"value":"#7a3e9d|12","label":"","sy